<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine flour mill buys 40,000T U.S. wheat.</title>
<headline>Philippine flour mill buys 40,000T U.S. wheat.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Philippine flour mill bought a total of 40,000 tonnes of U.S. wheat early this week, traders said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Traders said that of the 40,000 tonnes, some 23,000 tonnes of dark nothern spring wheat were bought for $192 to $193 per tonne.</p>
